    passiveDescription: "\U0001F517 <b>Imposing</b>: When I <b>attack \U0001F4A5</b>
      I get <b><color=#15c>\xD71</color></b> <b><color=#900>damage</color></b> <i>(for
      that attack)</i> when the target's <b><color=#b90>cost</color></b> is  less
      than <b>4</b>.\n\U0001F517 <b>Diamond dust</b>: Grants <b><color=#15c>+2</color></b>
      <b><color=#b50>armor pierce</color></b> to me.\n"
    passiveBuffDescriptions: "<b>\U0001F4A5 On hit</b>: <b><color=#15c>\xD71</color></b>
      <b><color=#900>damage</color></b> when the target's <b><color=#b90>cost</color></b>
      is  less than <b>4</b>, from my passive <b></b>\n<b><color=#15c>+2</color></b>
      <b><color=#b50>armor pierce</color></b> from my passive <b></b>\n"
    actionsDescription: "\u2694\uFE0F Melee or \U0001F3AF ranged attack.\nA \u2694\uFE0F
      Melee attack and a \U0001F3AF Ranged attack.\n"
